[00:48.22] Hold it close until it fades away
[00:54.29] Look up in the sky at night
[00:56.54] And all the stars, they look so bright
[00:59.43] It's beautiful, but then they go away
[01:04.98] Ever want something so bad
[01:07.79] It made you happy, made you mad
[01:10.50] Then you gave up and that's real bad, they say
